=====Build a simple grading system: take marks as input and print the grade (A/B/C/D/F) using if-elif-else=====

marks=int(input("Enter Student Marks:"))
if marks>=90:
    print("Grade:A")
elif marks>=80:
    print("Grade:B")
elif marks>=60:
    print("Grade:C")
else:
    print("Grade:D")



====Write a program to check whether a given year is a leap year.====

year=int(input("Entry The Year:"))
if year%4==0 and year%100==0:
    if year%400==0:
        print("Leaf Year")
    else:
        print("Not A Leaf Year")
else: 
    print("Leaf Year")



=====Write a program that takes three numbers and prints the largest among them without using max().=====

a=int(input("enter a:"))
b=int(input("enter b:"))
c=int(input("enter c:"))

if a>=b and a>=c:
    print ("A Is Largest:",a)
elif b>=a and b>=c:
    print("B Is Largest:",b)
else:
    print("C Is Largest:",c)




