=====Build a simple electricity bill calculator with different rates for different unit slabs (e.g., 0-100, 101-300, 301+).====

Unit=int(input("Enter The Electricity Bill Unit:"))
if Unit>=100:
    Bill=Unit*2
elif Unit>=300:
    Bill=Unit*3
elif Unit>=500:
    Bill=Unit*5
else: 
    Bill=Unit*1
print("Electricity Bill:",Bill)            